===Etymology===
{{rfe}}
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|sprotte|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|sprott||lang=ang}}, cognate with {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|Sprott|lang=de}} and {{etyl|no|-}} {{term|sprot||lang=no|small rod}}; probably related to ''[[sprout]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/spɹæt/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|æt|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sprat|sprats}}

# Any of various small, [[herring]]-like, marine fish in the genus {{taxlink|Sprattus|genus|noshow=1}}, in the family [[Clupeidae]].

